From: Gaudi port <gaudi-port@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 12:27:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] patch 61: per-layer expert routing histogram, opt-in with
 GLM53_ROUTE_HIST_DIR

Counts real (unpadded) token-slots per global expert id in every MoE op, split prompt/decode, with RESET/DUMP
control files answered by rank 0. Used to find experts an accounting-firm workload never routes to.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
